{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56033","headline":"颂云门三句语（幷余颂八首） 提纲商量 · 缘密","name":"颂云门三句语（幷余颂八首） 提纲商量","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"若欲正提纲，直须大地荒。\n欲来冲雪刃，不免露（《天圣广灯录》作「碎」）锋鋩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"缘密","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56033.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56033","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}